<main id="main-content"><div class="page-intro page-intro--visual"><div class="page-intro-layout site-container"><div class="page-intro-copy"><p class="brand-eyebrow">HELP &amp; FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</p><h1>A clearer path<br>to your next step.</h1><p>Practical answers about products, quotation requests, project stages and business partnerships.</p></div><?php require APP_ROOT . "/includes/page-intro-visual.php"; ?></div></div><section class="section-space"><div class="site-container"><div class="faq-list">
<details open><summary>How do I request products for retail, wholesale or hospitality supply?</summary><p>Browse the <a href="products.php">product catalog</a>, open a product for pack and minimum-order information, and add the products you need to your inquiry cart. Submit your contact and delivery requirements. A reference number is shown after the request is saved.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does submitting a request confirm an order or take payment?</summary><p>No. The website records your requirements for our team to review. Prices, product specifications, availability, delivery charges and payment arrangements require confirmation. The website does not collect card payments.</p></details>
<details><summary>What do the project stages mean?</summary><p>Planned describes a portfolio concept. Under development means the project is being developed. Operational is used only after the business confirms it. Temporarily unavailable indicates an interruption. You can ask our team for current project information.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can international buyers request quotations or samples?</summary><p>Use the <a href="export.php">export inquiry form</a> to share the product, quantity, country and packaging requirements. You can indicate interest in samples. Our team will discuss availability, sample arrangements, documentation and shipping individually.</p></details>
<details><summary>How can I discuss distribution, technology or investment?</summary><p>Use the <a href="partners.php">business partner form</a> for distribution and commercial relationships, or the <a href="investment.php">investment interest form</a> to select a project and describe your proposal. An expression of interest does not create an agreement.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are the photographs actual Forest Lanka products or facilities?</summary><p>Industry photographs are illustrative. Contact our team for current product photographs, confirmed specifications, project documentation or a discussion about a facility visit.</p></details>
<details><summary>How do I follow up after submitting?</summary><p>Keep your reference number and include it when contacting our team by <a href="mailto:<?= e($site['email']) ?>">email</a>, <a href="tel:<?= e(preg_replace('/[^+0-9]/','',$site['phone'])) ?>">telephone</a> or WhatsApp. Staff review requests through the inquiry desk.</p></details>
</div></div></section></main>